Act as a senior brand strategist, premium digital art director, conversion-focused UX/UI designer, senior full-stack engineer, technical SEO specialist, accessibility reviewer, and Vercel deployment engineer.

Your task is to build a complete, professional, conversion-oriented website for **VARENO**, a full-stack website development brand.

